  "name": "2001 March-April Underway pCO 2 Data: R/V Ka'imimoana",
  "description": "Atmospheric and surface sea water pCO2 on board the NOAA ship, Ka'imimoana. Measurements taken by PMEL scientists from March 29 to April 16, 2001. Underway pCO2 data are available on-line via FTP. See http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/co2/uwpco2/uwpco2_ftp.html to gain data access via a terminal session or go directly to ftp://ftp.pmel.noaa.gov/uwpCO2/ .\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To create seasonal flux maps.",
